      "comments": [],
      "data": "Jim Velez: I was able to reproduce this on the latest cert pipeline. The snapshot is stale only when the rollout advances between the initial fetch and the smoke execution, so we may need to re-read the flag state before each check or invalidate the cached view sooner.",
